UPDATE public.stories SET title = 'Creating AI characters has never been this accessible. I just discovered a powerful workflow to create fully customized AI characters with perfect lip-sync and voice changing capabilities. Here''s the full step-by-step process I used: First, I recorded myself as the "driving video" - this captures all the facial expressions and movements. Then I generated a custom character image in Midjourney that I wanted to bring to life. The magic happens when you combine multiple AI tools: @pika for the initial Character swap (though it missed the lip-sync) @runwayml Act One to perfectly transfer my mouth movements @elevenlabs.io to transform my voice into a British female accent This workflow gives you COMPLETE control over your character''s appearance, movements, and voice. What''s revolutionary is how these tools are eliminating traditional animation barriers. A process that once required entire studios can now be done by a single creator. Imagine the possibilities - custom animations, business commercials, short films, or even digital avatars of yourself speaking multiple languages. The AI creative revolution isn''t replacing creators - it''s supercharging what they can accomplish alone. Who''s excited to try this workflow? Drop a comment if you want me to break down any specific part of the process in more detail! #aicreator #runwayml #elevenlabs #midjourney #aicharacter #techtutorial #aieducation #aianimation #digitalcreator #contentcreation #fyp #voiceai #aivoice #characterdesign #aiart #digitalcharacter #techtools #creativetutorial #aigenerated #creatortools #aiediting #learnontiktok #creativetechnology #videoediting #lipsync #futuretech #aiworkflow #creatorsoftiktok #aivideo #techhacks' WHERE slug = 'tiktok-7491354650931678495';
UPDATE public.stories SET title = 'I created this guide because so many of us are trying to manage intense emotions without ever learning how. We’re told to “calm down” or “take a breath,” but when your nervous system is activated, those things aren’t always accessible, especially if you don’t know what your body actually needs. Self-regulation isn’t about being calm all the time. It’s about understanding your system, noticing what state you’re in, and learning how to support yourself through it. Not to fix it, not to avoid it but to move through it in a way that’s grounded and safe. Because you don’t need to be “less sensitive” or “more in control.” You just need the right kind of support.' WHERE slug = 'tiktok-7488392492560289029';
